格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"桥接 GitHub Copilot 订阅到 DeepSeek Harness（移植自 github/copilot-sdk）","id":"gh:1335106024","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-copilot-sdk","slug":"GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-copilot-sdk","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"桥接 GitHub Copilot 订阅到 DeepSeek Harness（移植自 github/copilot-sdk）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-copilot-sdk"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**把 GitHub Copilot 订阅接进 DeepSeek Harness：一个 `copilot` LLM provider，直接使用你订阅里的模型（GPT、Claude、DeepSeek……"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"），SDK 库与测试套件 100% 逐字移植自上游。**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"本插件是 `@github/copilot-sdk`（MIT，github/copilot-sdk）的 **dsh 移植**（port），版本钉在 `1.0.11`（commit `18002a81`"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"）。SDK 库本体与上游逐字一致（见 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 的 SHA-256 校验）；`.pi/` 下的桥接层是本移植自己的代码。喜欢的话，也请给上游一个 star ⭐"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 功能"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Copilot 订阅即模型池**：注册 `copilot` provider，订阅里可用的模型（`gpt-5`、`claude-sonnet-4.5`、`deepseek-r1` 等）直接出现"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"在 dsh 的模型列表里\n- **复刻 Copilot CLI 引擎**：SDK 自带 Copilot CLI runtime，无需单独安装 CLI；认证走你已有的 GitHub 登录 / token"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" / BYOK\n- **纯聊天桥接**：桥接层拒绝一切工具执行请求——Copilot 的 shell、文件编辑等工具绝不会在你的机器上代跑\n- **流式输出**：assistant 文本与 reaso"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ning（思维链）增量实时转发\n- **`/copilot` 命令**：`status` 查看连接与模型数、`models` 列出可用模型、`stop` 停掉 CLI runtime\n- **100%"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" 逐字移植**：SDK 库、docs、samples、测试套件（含离线 replay 的 e2e）全部原样保留，`npm test` 全绿"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 效果"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- 每次模型调用对应一个一次性 Copilot 会话：订阅计费走 Copilot 的计费模型（每次 prompt 计入用量）\n- 无 Copilot 订阅时也可以用 BYOK（Bring Your O"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" Copilot 会话：订阅计费走 Copilot 的计费模型（每次 prompt 计入用量）\n- 无 Copilot 订阅时也可以用 BYOK（Bring Your Own Key），见下方 FAQ"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> 尚未发布到 npm —— 从 GitHub 或本地目录安装："},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"pnpm 默认阻止 git 安装的构建脚本（`prepare`）。如果 `add` 报 `allowBuilds` 错误，\n把 pnpm 打印的精确 key 加进 profile 的 `pnpm-wo"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"rkspace.yaml` 的 `allowBuilds` 再重试；\n本插件的原生依赖（`koffi` FFI）可能被连带拦截，同样放行后重跑。"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"安装后重启 dsh。插件按需拉起 Copilot CLI（首次模型调用 / `/copilot status` 时），\n不需要订阅之外的任何配置。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 使用"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**dsh 侧命令：** `/copilot status` `/copilot models` `/copilot stop`"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**作为模型 provider：** 安装后，会话的模型选择器里会出现 `copilot` provider\n及其订阅模型（也可在 agent 配置里指定 `provider: copilot` + "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ovider：** 安装后，会话的模型选择器里会出现 `copilot` provider\n及其订阅模型（也可在 agent 配置里指定 `provider: copilot` + 具体模型 id）。"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 配置"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"全部走环境变量（与上游 SDK 一致）："},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `COPILOT_GITHUB_TOKEN` / `GH_TOKEN` / `GITHUB_TOKEN` —— GitHub 认证 token（缺省用 `copilot` CLI 的已登录用户）\n"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"- BYOK：在 session/agent 配置里用 SDK 的 provider 配置指定你自己的 API key（OpenAI / Anthropic / 其他）"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## FAQ"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **需要 Copilot 订阅吗？** 需要（含免费额度档），除非用 BYOK。\n- **桥接会执行 Copilot 的工具吗？** 不会。桥接层把所有权限请求判为拒绝，Copilot 只作为聊天"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"模型回答。\n- **模型调用怎么计费？** 与 Copilot CLI 相同，每次 prompt 计入你的 Copilot 用量。\n- **SDK 完整 API 可用吗？** 可用。库本身是逐字移植，"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"API 与上游 `@github/copilot-sdk` 一致；\n完整 API 参考见上游 README 与 `docs/`。"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"MIT —— 见 LICENSE。上游为 github/copilot-sdk（MIT）。"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"授权 / 合规询问 → GitHub issues。"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**遥测说明：** 上游 SDK 自带 telemetry 代码（`src/telemetry.ts` 与 GitHub telemetry 转发），\n本移植逐字保留、未删改。本插件的桥接层不传入 t"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"elemetry options、也不注册 handler，\n因此**默认不发送**；若你自行构造 `CopilotClient` 并启用，则以上游行为为准。"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"# dsh-copilot-sdk"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"简体中文 | English"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"**Bring your GitHub Copilot subscription into DeepSeek Harness: a `copilot` LLM provider that serves"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" the models in your subscription (GPT, Claude, DeepSeek, …), with the SDK library and test suite por"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ted 100% verbatim from upstream.**"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"This plugin is a **dsh port** of `@github/copilot-sdk`\n(MIT, github/copilot-sdk), pinned to\n`1.0.11`"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" (commit `18002a81`). The SDK library is byte-identical to upstream\n(see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for "},{"id":"p31s3","text":"SHA-256 checks);\nthe bridge under `.pi/` is this port's own code. If you like it,\nstar the upstream "},{"id":"p31s4","text":"56 checks);\nthe bridge under `.pi/` is this port's own code. If you like it,\nstar the upstream too ⭐"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **Your Copilot subscription as a model pool**: a `copilot` provider whose models\n(`gpt-5`, `claude"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"-sonnet-4.5`, `deepseek-r1`, …) show up in dsh's model list\n- **The Copilot CLI engine, embedded**: "},{"id":"p33s3","text":"the SDK bundles the Copilot CLI runtime —\nno separate CLI install; auth via your existing GitHub log"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"in / token / BYOK\n- **Chat-only bridge**: every tool permission request is denied — Copilot's shell,"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"\nfile-edit, and other tools never run on your machine\n- **Streaming**: assistant text and reasoning "},{"id":"p33s6","text":"deltas are forwarded live\n- **`/copilot` command**: `status` (connection + model count), `models` (l"},{"id":"p33s7","text":"ist), `stop` (shut the CLI down)\n- **100% verbatim port**: SDK library, docs, samples, and the full "},{"id":"p33s8","text":"test suite\n(including offline-replay e2e) kept as-is; `npm test` is green"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- Each model call uses a fresh one-shot Copilot session; billing follows Copilot's\nown model (each p"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"rompt counts toward your usage allowance)\n- No subscription? BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) works too — s"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"counts toward your usage allowance)\n- No subscription? BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) works too — see FAQ"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"> Not published to npm yet — install from GitHub or a local checkout:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"pnpm blocks git-hosted installs from running the `prepare` build script until\nallowed — if `add` fai"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"ls with an `allowBuilds` error, add the exact key pnpm\nprinted under `allowBuilds` in the profile's "},{"id":"p40s3","text":"`pnpm-workspace.yaml`, then re-run.\nThe native dependency (`koffi` FFI) may be blocked next; allow i"},{"id":"p40s4","text":".yaml`, then re-run.\nThe native dependency (`koffi` FFI) may be blocked next; allow it the same way."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Restart dsh after installing. The plugin starts the Copilot CLI on demand\n(first model call / `/copi"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"lot status`); no config beyond your existing GitHub auth."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"**dsh-side commands:** `/copilot status` `/copilot models` `/copilot stop`"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"**As a model provider:** after install, the session model selector shows the\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
